<title>UK: BOE gives money mkt 340 mln stg help at set rates.</title>
<headline>BOE gives money mkt 340 mln stg help at set rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 340 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>			    EARLY	1100 GMT   1300 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.0 BLN    1.1 BLN    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY	2 MLN    342 MLN    =	    =</p>
<p> BAND 1  BANK BILLS     2 MLN*   340 MLN*   =	    =</p>
<p>* INTEREST RATE - 5-11/16 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
